# Documentation and planning files

- **Planning notes, implementation writeups, setup guides, checklists, and similar markdown** belong in **`plans/`** at the repository root (same directory level as `app/`, `components/`, etc.).
- **Do not add** those files to the project root; keep the root limited to **`README.md`** and essential config.
- When creating or updating a plan document, prefer **`plans/<descriptive-name>.md`** and link to it from code comments or PRs as needed.
